---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Partnerships"
  description="Partner with System Internals to reach senior engineers, SREs, and backend developers with your infrastructure products."
  ogTitle="Affiliate Partnerships — System Internals"
  ogDescription="Partner with System Internals to reach senior engineers, SREs, and backend developers with your infrastructure products."
>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Partner With Us</p>
      <h1>Affiliate Partnerships</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        System Internals reaches senior engineers, DevOps, and backend developers who make infrastructure purchasing decisions.
        If your product helps them build, debug, or scale systems — let's talk.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Why Partner With System Internals</h2>
      <ul class="stats">
        <li>
          <span class="stat-value">Deep technical audience</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">Readers are the engineers who actually evaluate and buy infrastructure tools — not managers.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="stat-value">High-intent traffic</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">Our readers come looking for solutions to real problems. They're actively researching, not browsing casually.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="stat-value">Trusted content</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">The blog has published detailed, technical deep dives on Linux, databases, networking, and distributed systems.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Who We're Looking For</h2>
      <p>We partner with products that fit the audience:</p>
      <ul class="product-list">
        <li><strong>Cloud infrastructure &amp; VPS</strong> — Cloud providers, serverless platforms, bare metal</li>
        <li><strong>Observability &amp; monitoring</strong> — APM, tracing, logging, metrics, alerting</li>
        <li><strong>Developer tooling</strong> — CI/CD, container platforms, databases, caches</li>
        <li><strong>Networking &amp; security</strong> — CDNs, DNS, DDoS protection, VPNs, certificate management</li>
        <li><strong>Performance profiling</strong> — Profiling tools, benchmarking, load testing</li>
        <li><strong>Managed services</strong> — Managed databases, queues, search, observability SaaS</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Partnership Options</h2>
      <div class="tiers">
        <div class="tier">
          <h3>Affiliate Links</h3>
          <p>We embed referral links in relevant posts and resource pages. You get a commission on any referred customers — typically 10% recurring for 12 months. Clean, honest recommendations only.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier">
          <h3>Sponsored Content</h3>
          <p>A well-researched post about your product, written to our editorial standards. Not a press release — a genuine technical piece that helps readers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tier">
          <h3>Newsletter Feature</h3>
          <p>A mention or mini-review in our newsletter to our subscriber base. High open rates, direct delivery.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <h2>Interested?</h2>
      <p>
        If you have a product that genuinely helps systems engineers, reach out with a brief intro:
        who you are, what you offer, and why it's relevant to our audience.
      </p>
      <p class="contact">
        You can find us through the <a href="/about">contact info on the About page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .stats li {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .stat-value {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .stat-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .product-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .product-list strong {
    color: var(--text);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .product-list li::before {
    content: '→';
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .tiers {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tier {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tier h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .tier p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .cta h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cta p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .cta .contact {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .cta a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .cta a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>